	<s:String x:Key="/Default/PatternsAndTemplates/LiveTemplates/Template/=8EDC9EAE01BA5E46889BED73CD78784E/Text/@EntryValue">public $TypeName$ $PropertyName$&#xD;
{&#xD;
  get {return $SELECTION$;}&#xD;
  set &#xD;
  {&#xD;
    if ($SELECTION$ == value)&#xD;
	{&#xD;
	  return;&#xD;
	}&#xD;
    $SELECTION$ = value;&#xD;
    PropertyChanged.Raise(this);&#xD;
  }&#xD;
}  </s:String>
